    "body": "I think it might better to append the env value instead of replacing and restoring it, maybe even adding it twice to test your upstream PR (thanks for fixing the upstream bug I introduced!).\r\nBeyond that, shouldn't the tests already pass on Windows? You are only adding a single path (so there is no platform-specific delimiter), there might be more issues here.",
